@GaNe_HostAddress = http://localhost:5135

### Create adventurer
POST {{GaNe_HostAddress}}/api/Adventure/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aragorn",
  "archetype": 1,
  "sex": 0,
  "isLive": true,
  "rating": 10
}

### Get all adventurers
GET {{GaNe_HostAddress}}/api/Adventure/all
Accept: application/json

### Get adventurer by id (200)
GET {{GaNe_HostAddress}}/api/Adventure/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Get adventurer by id (404)
GET {{GaNe_HostAddress}}/api/Adventure/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Mark adventurer dead
POST {{GaNe_HostAddress}}/api/Adventure/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/dead
